摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A DeepSeek Harness Web plugin for real-time Token usage, cost estimates, per-round charts, and DeepSeek API balance.","id":"gh:1333451113","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-usage-chart","slug":"Max-Samson/dsh-usage-chart","topics":["ai-cost","awesome","awesome-dsh-plugin","data-visualization","deepseek","deepseek-api","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","token-usage"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness Web plugin for real-time Token usage, cost estimates, per-round charts, and DeepS"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ss Web plugin for real-time Token usage, cost estimates, per-round charts, and DeepSeek API balance."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-usage-chart"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> A usage, cost, and account-balance dashboard for DeepSeek Harness Web."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"简体中文 · Report an issue · Changelog (EN) · 更新日志（中文）"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Interface preview: light English on the left and dark Simplified Chinese on the right. Both variants"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" follow the DSH theme and in-app language setting."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Light theme · English"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Dark theme · 简体中文"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> Both screenshots use fictional demo data only. They contain no real session content, token counts,"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" costs, balances, or API keys."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The plugin adds a compact indicator below the conversation composer. It shows input/output tokens, c"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ache-hit ratio, estimated cost, active model, a multi-segment context-pressure bar (system/tools/mes"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"sages breakdown, v1.1.0), and DeepSeek account balance. Click it to open a zero-dependency SVG dashb"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"oard with per-turn usage history — including a cost view (every bar shows its own cost value, not ju"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"st the current round), a duration overlay, anomaly markers, an explainer tooltip (tokens + cost + mo"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"del + billing tier + duration/TTFT/TPS + **user input source attribution: human/agent/continuation**"},{"id":"p9s7","text":", v1.1.0 + end reason), horizontally scrollable per-round bars (all rounds, fixed slim bar width, au"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"to-scroll to latest), a dedicated **Context & Compaction Diagnostics section** (system/tools/message"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"s token composition, compaction timeline, freed tokens, summarize cost, context occupancy suggestion"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"s, v1.1.0), a dismissible `≈ ¥/$0.00xx` badge on each assistant message, peak/off-peak tiered billin"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"g with a live red/green billing-tier tag in the panel (red = peak, green = off-peak, v1.0.1), and of"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"ficial dual-currency pricing (CNY from the Chinese pricing page, USD from the English pricing page —"},{"id":"p9s13","text":"dual-currency pricing (CNY from the Chinese pricing page, USD from the English pricing page — [长行截断]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Data sources"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Metric | Source | Accuracy |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Token usage | DSH official adapter session projections (`tokenUsage` / `contextPressure`) | ✅ Offi"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"cial real-time data |\n| Cost | Official list price (builtin + optional `pricing.json` override, CNY/"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"USD dual-currency / 1M tokens, peak/off-peak tiers) × reported usage | ⚠️ Estimate, not invoice; res"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"olved via Host `/pricing` snapshot |\n| Display currency | Host `/meta` config; costs directly calcul"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"ated in selected currency list price | ✅ Official dual-currency list price |\n| Per-round history | H"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"ost session log fold (`/usage`): duration / TTFT / TPS / model attribution / **input source attribut"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"ion** / end reason / per-round cost. DSH 0.2.x counts `assistant/message` and failed `assistant/atte"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"mpt` usage (including stream-only samples); TTFT uses the first token-bearing fragment, and TPS uses"},{"id":"p14s9","text":" summed per-attempt generation time; 0.1.x keeps chunk/usage anchors | ✅ Official event stream fold "},{"id":"p14s10","text":"|\n| Context & compaction | Official `contextBreakdown` / `contextPressure` projections + Host `compa"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"ction/*` event fold | ✅ Official projections + event fold |\n| Balance | Official `GET https://api.de"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"epseek.com/user/balance` | ✅ Official real-time data |\n| Model name | Host history: `request/context"},{"id":"p14s13","text":"` → `request/header` → last model; live nodes: `provenance` (0.1.x) → `providerMetadata` (0.2.x) → `"},{"id":"p14s14","text":"requestConfig` | ✅ Official real-time data |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Tech stack"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- **Language**: TypeScript source, compiled to DSH loadable JavaScript bundles\n- **Framework**: Cord"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"is plugin model + React 18\n- **Build**: esbuild (Host half = Node ESM; Client half = browser factory"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" bundle matching DSH Web `PLATFORM_MODULES`)\n- **Visualization**: Zero-dependency handcrafted SVG (m"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"atches platform rendering, minimal footprint, ultra-stable)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Prerequisites: **DeepSeek Harness ≥ 0.1.0-rc.6** · **Node.js ≥ 20** · **pnpm on PATH** (`dsh plugin`"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" forwards installs to pnpm)."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> If you get `dsh: command not found` (or PowerShell `The term 'dsh' is not recognized…`),\n> you ran"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh` transiently — see FAQ item 1 (install globally, or prefix commands with `npx"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh`)."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Option 1: npm registry (recommended, prebuilt — no build tooling needed)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Plugin architecture"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Data and security boundaries"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- Token and context data come from the active DSH session projections; per-round chart reads the ses"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"sion log and falls back to page-observed deltas if unavailable.\n- Costs are estimated based on offic"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ial list prices (user-overridable via `pricing.json`); price resolution happens only on the Host.\n- "},{"id":"p26s4","text":"Currency and rates: `/meta` delivers display config; `/rate` proxies live FX rates via the Host (bro"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"wser never directly contacts external rate providers); rate URLs require HTTPS (loopback HTTP allowe"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"d for local testing).\n- Balance is queried via the same-origin Host proxy (direct browser requests h"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"ave CORS and key-exposure risks).\n- Host routes only accept same-origin GET requests and set `no-sto"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"re` on JSON responses; the plugin never sends the API key to the browser."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Component | Supported |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| DSH | Declared peer range: `>=0.1.0-rc.6 <0.3.0-0` (0.1.x / 0.2.x). DSH 0.2.x prefers `engines.dsh"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"` when present and falls back to matching the `@deepseek-ai/dsh*` peer ranges otherwise; this plugin"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" deliberately stays on the peer fallback so each client-SDK package stays version-gated. The `/usage"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"` route prefers `snapshotEvents()` with a legacy `events` fallback (`Session.events` was removed in "},{"id":"p29s5","text":"`0.1.2-rc.1`). See validation scope below. |\n| Node.js | ≥ 20 |\n| Web UI | React 18 / `conversation."},{"id":"p29s6","text":"composer.dock` + `conversation.chat.assistant-actions` |\n| OS | macOS, Linux, Windows (pure JavaScri"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"pt, no native dependencies) |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Validation scope for v1.1.8: regression tests cover both event shapes. The compatibility PR author r"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"eported a linked-build browser smoke test on DSH 0.2.1-rc.2; this is not evidence of clean-profile i"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"nstallation on both lines. No live 0.1.x installation was re-run after removing `dsh-client-runtime`"},{"id":"p30s4","text":" from `dsh.client.inject`. Record each runtime/version and clean-profile result before claiming full"},{"id":"p30s5","text":" installation coverage."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
